				message="4.13 short changelog"
				[command]
					[message]
						message="Version 4.13:
* Eras and Factions
    * New era: Era of Chaos, merged factions too close to EE or EoS or EoM or FE
    * New faction: Menagerie in Archaic Era
    * EE and misc khalifates removed in favour of default
* Graphics
    * Fixed some missing images including ellipses
* Extensive changes
    * Full redo of Archaic Era
    * Cost increase of most level 3-4 units
    * XP increase for amlas and lowering for level 2->3 advance
    * Too many mostly small balance changes and fixes to list here
* Bug Fixes
    * Fixed Cursedsword preventing plague and other specials
    * Fixed random faction selections
* Other
    * Added quick leaders and time over event
    * Factions and eras sorting changed to alphabetical"
						speaker="narrator"
					[/message]
					[fire_event]
						name="AE_show_changelog_menu"
