			[/option]
			[option]
				message="4.12.1 changelog"
				[command]
					[message]
						message="Version 4.12.1:
* Graphics
    * Reduced Jinn attack animation, fixed Tharis Witch ones
    * New archaic portraits
* Balance
    * Started implementing Terrapin balance
    * Arrow Fury increased to 50%, Buffed Steel Larva
    * Some units stats increased
* Critical Bug Fixes
    * Fleshpool Sacrifice
    * Hex cure on village
    * Despair impassable movetypes
* Bug Fixes
    * Penumbra, Adamantine shell, Wyvern traits
    * RPG era Tharis faction select image
* Other
    * Awake happens before unit is dead, xp changed from kill xp to 4
    * Latch warns about false positive oos
    * Dropping support of wesnoth 1.10"
						speaker="narrator"
					[/message]
					[fire_event]
						name="AE_show_changelog_menu"
					[/fire_event]
				[/command]
			[/option]
			[option]
				message="4.12 short changelog"
				[command]
					[message]
						message="Version 4.12:
* Eras and Factions and Units
    * Added new faction: Frozen under AE, added steelhive to heroes
    * EoM Water Nymph, Ukian Subcommander, Steel Nymph line, Dark Thunderblade, Amoeba, Titan, Khalkotaurus, Sunwheel
* Graphics
    * Deadzone animation, fixes of few other ones
* Balance
    * Elementalist heal, Grenade, Rune Aura, Dog Training, Brungar Alligator riders, Vector, Swallow, Ryu line, Sapper
    * Destroyers, Cavernei, Orcei, Despair, Avians, Infernai, Windsong, Wood Warriors, Welkin
* Bug Fixes
    * Petrify, Rune Improver, Latch, Guru and Roc summon, High Elf Formation, many reef movetypes
    * Conflicts with Archaic
* Other
    * Unique ability for Cavernei: Runelaying
    * Too many changes to list here, for full changelog check forum
* Outstanding issues
    * Blight, Steelhive, Equestrians, Elementals, Celestials, High Elves, Minotaurs balance"
						speaker="narrator"
					[/message]
					[fire_event]
						name="AE_show_changelog_menu"
					[/fire_event]
				[/command]
			[/option]
